{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Geo Tracker 是一款路線記錄工具，適合步行、遠足、跑步與單車愛好者。它會在地圖上畫出整段行程，沿途可標記地點並保留相片，完成後更能儲存 GPX 檔案。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-35.webp\">\n<h2>記錄路線並標記沿途相片</h2>\n<p>Geo Tracker 在地圖上實時顯示路線，距離、時間、配速與爬升一目瞭然，鎖屏後仍持續記錄，也可暫停或啟用自動暫停。途中可加入航點或拍照標記，相片依拍攝時間放回路線；Apple Watch 可直接暫停、繼續或儲存。完成後可儲存 GPX 或匯出 KML 分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-95-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-96-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-97-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-98-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-99-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-100-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Geo Tracker: GPS Tracking</li>\n<li>應用類別：Navigation</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T02:01:37.368273+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:38:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:39.645303+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:57:47.130306+00:00","content_hash":"9a172f908890703cdc1cb1ef17f273e31a3b83f2a0e711a9fa2121ef13ef4d54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}